(text "Conn1/J506 = west, closest to FPGA (PCIe x16); Conn2/J603 = north-center (PCIe x4); Conn3/J604 = south-center (PCIe x4). All three card-edge sites are on the main-board bottom. The risers are user-made PCBs with card-edge fingers at both ends (SEAR interposers struck 2026-11-16 - not purchasable). Each pre-reg rail sits beside its own GND return; 10 uF local bulk per rail per connector - the heavy bulk/filtering lives on the pre-reg board. PWR_FLAGs are in the rails table on REFS_L." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 118.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86982afb-f374-4f04-87f2-7b427d300e04"))
(text "Conn1 only (PCIe x16): V12SOM uses 20 side-A contacts with GND returns; V33_IF_IN uses four (A57-A60) inside the return field and feeds the local 1.8 V LDO; it is not VAP_IO/GND_AP." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 136.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d94f0f9-cfe3-4bd6-8336-d4d4152555c2"))
