(text "PG_ALL = wired-AND of every POL power-good, HARDWARE ONLY (bom 17(m)): 8 x LT3045 + 4 x LT3094 + V33CLK LT3045 PG pins (open-collector) + U1701/U1702 TPS3890 RESETs (one per V33FF bank); pull-up R1701 10k to V18 (SoM rail - sets the 1.8 V logic level for U602 and the FPGA IO). High = all analog + clock rails in regulation -> OUT sheet U602 unmute gate (with RLY_LINE_MUTE + FPGA_DONE) and FPGA J1-B7/N29 (PG_ALL) for the soak/unmute sequencer. The UCD90120A monitors on CTRL are TELEMETRY ONLY - a blank UCD cannot unmute or hold the output." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 150.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c620d3fd-6d04-43b2-aebb-976cc95a84dc"))
